This smoothly feathered creature coos gently as it struts about, scavenging
for any left over morsels of food. Its wide black eyes peer cautiously about,
ever alert for some predator.

The Avatar is the symbol of courage and truth and love, and all that descends
from it.  He has mastered Compassion, Humility, Justice, Spirituality, Honesty,
Sacrifice, Valor, and Honor.  He truly is an inspiration to those who know him.
